        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Whisper Village</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932980/extras/32aceaf0769e76643687e6f07cb70c50.avif?t=1762800179\" width=1366 height=768 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> &quot;Some villages don't appear on maps.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >American documentary filmmaker Calvin Walker is forced to seek shelter in a remote, misty part of Turkey when his path is blocked. He finds a nearby village — but this place is far from ordinary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Silent homes, cold yet kind faces, dark secrets buried in the past...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What was meant to be a short stay quickly turns into a disturbing realization: nothing is as it seems. And now, escaping isn't just about finding a road — it's a fight for salvation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 <strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story-driven, single-player psychological horror experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cinematic narration and atmospheric environmental storytelling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tense missions and character-focused dialogues</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark village setting in the early 2000s</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local elements inspired by Turkish horror culture</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready?</strong><br><i>When the line between reality and illusion blurs, the only escape is to confront it.<br>But... not every truth is meant for everyone.</i></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Whisper Village</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932980/extras/32aceaf0769e76643687e6f07cb70c50.avif?t=1762800179\" width=1366 height=768 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> &quot;Some villages don't appear on maps.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >American documentary filmmaker Calvin Walker is forced to seek shelter in a remote, misty part of Turkey when his path is blocked. He finds a nearby village — but this place is far from ordinary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Silent homes, cold yet kind faces, dark secrets buried in the past...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What was meant to be a short stay quickly turns into a disturbing realization: nothing is as it seems. And now, escaping isn't just about finding a road — it's a fight for salvation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 <strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story-driven, single-player psychological horror experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cinematic narration and atmospheric environmental storytelling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tense missions and character-focused dialogues</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark village setting in the early 2000s</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local elements inspired by Turkish horror culture</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready?</strong><br><i>When the line between reality and illusion blurs, the only escape is to confront it.<br>But... not every truth is meant for everyone.</i></p>",
        "short_description": "A story full of extreme tension and fear that a man who came just to shoot a documentary went through. Let's see if you can see the end of the story",
